      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Lafayette and Indianapolis Railroad ran through Lebanon from 1852 until 1985, and parts of its former line now form the Big 4 or Farm Heritage Trail.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
